menu "DragonBreath heater"

config PB_FIRST_HEAT_REPORT_ONLY
    bool "First-heat check: report only, never latch"
    default n
    help
        If disabled (the default), a "wrong roles" or "no rise" result of the
        first-heat check latches the heater off (see docs/SAFETY.md). If
        enabled, the check only reports its result in the API and never
        latches or stores a result. Enable it only to recover from a false trip
        on a unit that you checked by hand. There is no runtime toggle. A safe
        dev-board build always reports only. The option is inverted on purpose:
        a build that does not know the option enforces the check.

endmenu
